cm]","charaName":"研究员斯纳尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不过刚才有研究员回来时带了一些东西，你们看看能不能用得上？[l][cm]","charaName":"研究员斯纳尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这是……熔火结晶吧。应该是从刚刚的熔火元素身上掉落的材料。[l]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_13","text":"要不我给你们做个熔火护盾吧。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]熔火护盾？听起来挺不错的，那就拜托你了！[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"研究员斯纳尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":fal